meld-lang (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First stable release of Meld (v0.2.0).
  * Ships meld, meld-lsp and meld-pack with bundled Lang Pack data.
  * Upstream archives are signed in CI; this Debian source package is built
    without source or changes signing (dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc -b).

